  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Joshua",
    "delineation": "Chapter",
    "number": 18,
    "summary": "The tabernacle of the congregation is set up at Shiloh—Benjamin receives an inheritance by lot.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "And the whole congregation of the children of Israel assembled together at Shiloh, and set up the tabernacle of the congregation there. And the land was subdued before them.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 75,
            "end": 81,
            "text": "Judg. 20:26 (26–27); 1 Sam. 1:3 (3–18); 3:21; Jer. 7:12."
          },
          {
            "start": 98,
            "end": 108,
            "text": "HEB tent. TG Temple."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 1,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Joshua 18:1",
        "book": "Joshua",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "And there remained among the children of Israel seven tribes, which had not yet received their inheritance.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Joshua 18:2",
        "book": "Joshua",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "And Joshua said unto the children of Israel, How long are ye slack to go to possess the land, which the Lord God of your fathers hath given you?",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 54,
            "end": 57
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Joshua 18:3",
        "book": "Joshua",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "Give out from among you three men for each tribe: and I will send them, and they shall rise, and go through the land, and describe it according to the inheritance of them; and they shall come again to me.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 38,
            "end": 42
          },
          {
            "start": 192,
            "end": 197
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 4,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Joshua 18:4",
        "book": "Joshua",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "And they shall divide it into seven parts: Judah shall abide in their coast on the south, and the house of Joseph shall abide in their coasts on the north.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 70,
            "end": 75,
            "text": "HEB border (also vv. 11, 19–20). Judg. 11:22."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Joshua 18:5",
        "book": "Joshua",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "Ye shall therefore describe the land into seven parts, and bring the description hither to me, that I may cast lots for you here before the Lord our God.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 111,
            "end": 115,
            "text": "Josh. 14:2."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 37,
            "end": 41
          },
          {
            "start": 65,
            "end": 80
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Josh. 14:2.",
            "prettyString": "Joshua 14:2",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "joshua",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 14,
                    "end": 14,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 2,
                        "end": 2
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Joshua 18:6",
        "book": "Joshua",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "But the Levites have no part among you; for the priesthood of the Lord is their inheritance: and Gad, and Reuben, and half the tribe of Manasseh, have received their inheritance beyond Jordan on the east, which Moses the servant of the Lord gave them.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 8,
            "end": 15,
            "text": "TG Priesthood, Aaronic."
          },
          {
            "start": 80,
            "end": 91,
            "text": "TG Priesthood, History of."
          },
          {
            "start": 106,
            "end": 112,
            "text": "Josh. 22:1 (1–6)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 71,
            "end": 73
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Priesthood, Aaronic.",
            "prettyString": "TG Priesthood, Aaronic",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
                "studyHelpType": "tg",
                "title": "Priesthood, Aaronic",
                "entryId": "tg-priesthood-aaronic",
                "book": "",
                "chapters": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "raw": "TG Priesthood, History of.",
            "prettyString": "TG Priesthood, History of",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
                "studyHelpType": "tg",
                "title": "Priesthood, History of",
                "entryId": "tg-priesthood-history-of",
                "book": "",
                "chapters": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Joshua 18:7",
        "book": "Joshua",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "And the men arose, and went away: and Joshua charged them that went to describe the land, saying, Go and walk through the land, and describe it, and come again to me, that I may here cast lots for you before the Lord in Shiloh.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Joshua 18:8",
        "book": "Joshua",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "And the men went and passed through the land, and described it by cities into seven parts in a book, and came again to Joshua to the host at Shiloh.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 110,
            "end": 115
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Joshua 18:9",
        "book": "Joshua",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "And Joshua cast lots for them in Shiloh before the Lord: and there Joshua divided the land unto the children of Israel according to their divisions.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Joshua 18:10",
        "book": "Joshua",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "And the lot of the tribe of the children of Benjamin came up according to their families: and the coast of their lot came forth between the children of Judah and the children of Joseph.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 44,
            "end": 52,
            "text": "Gen. 42:4; 44:29; 49:27 (26–28)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Joshua 18:11",
        "book": "Joshua",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "And their border on the north side was from Jordan; and the border went up to the side of Jericho on the north side, and went up through the mountains westward; and the goings out thereof were at the wilderness of Beth-aven.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 214,
            "end": 223,
            "text": "Josh. 7:2."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Josh. 7:2.",
            "prettyString": "Joshua 7:2",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "joshua",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 7,
                    "end": 7,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 2,
                        "end": 2
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Joshua 18:12",
        "book": "Joshua",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "And the border went over from thence toward Luz, to the side of Luz, which is Beth-el, southward; and the border descended to Ataroth-adar, near the hill that lieth on the south side of the nether Beth-horon.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 64,
            "end": 67,
            "text": "Gen. 35:6; 48:3."
          },
          {
            "start": 190,
            "end": 196,
            "text": "OR lower."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 75,
            "end": 77
          },
          {
            "start": 159,
            "end": 164
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 13,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Gen. 35:6; 48:3.",
            "prettyString": "Genesis 35:6; 48:3",
            "references": [
              {
