        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Joshua 18:17",
        "book": "Joshua",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 17
      },
      {
        "text": "And passed along toward the side over against Arabah northward, and went down unto Arabah:",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 18,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Joshua 18:18",
        "book": "Joshua",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 18
      },
      {
        "text": "And the border passed along to the side of Beth-hoglah northward: and the outgoings of the border were at the north bay of the salt sea at the south end of Jordan: this was the south coast.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 123,
            "end": 135,
            "text": "IE the Dead Sea."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 169,
            "end": 172
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 19,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Joshua 18:19",
        "book": "Joshua",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 19
      },
      {
        "text": "And Jordan was the border of it on the east side. This was the inheritance of the children of Benjamin, by the coasts thereof round about, according to their families.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 55,
            "end": 58
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 20,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Joshua 18:20",
        "book": "Joshua",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 20
      },
      {
        "text": "Now the cities of the tribe of the children of Benjamin according to their families were Jericho, and Beth-hoglah, and the valley of Keziz,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 21,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Joshua 18:21",
        "book": "Joshua",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 21
      },
      {
        "text": "And Beth-arabah, and Zemaraim, and Beth-el,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 22,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Joshua 18:22",
        "book": "Joshua",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 22
      },
      {
        "text": "And Avim, and Parah, and Ophrah,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 23,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Joshua 18:23",
        "book": "Joshua",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 23
      },
      {
        "text": "And Chephar-haammonai, and Ophni, and Gaba; twelve cities with their villages:",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 24,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Joshua 18:24",
        "book": "Joshua",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 24
      },
      {
        "text": "Gibeon, and Ramah, and Beeroth,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 25,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Joshua 18:25",
        "book": "Joshua",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 25
      },
      {
